### Quick Create - Crea Organización + División + Subdivisión con body completo — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Acme Corporation",
  "contactPhone": "+502 2222-3333",
  "organizationAddress": "5ta Avenida 10-30 zona 1",
  "contactName": "Juan Pérez",
  "contactEmail": "juan.perez@acme.com",
  "operatorId": 1,
  "agentId": 5,
  "alertConsoleActive": true,
  "tradeName": "Acme Corp",
  "organizationType": 1,
  "divisionName": "División Norte",
  "subdivisionName": "Subdivisión Guatemala",
  "comments": "Organización creada desde la batería E2E"
}

### Quick Create - Solo campos requeridos (División y Subdivisión heredan el nombre de la Organización) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Organización Mínima E2E",
  "operatorId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Acme Corporation",
  "operatorId": 1
}

### Body inválido - falta organizationName (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": 1,
  "divisionName": "División Norte"
}

### Body inválido - falta operatorId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Acme Corporation"
}

### Body inválido - organizationName excede el máximo de 200 caracteres → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/quickCreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA",
  "operatorId": 1
}
